        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "cb6a918c-f97e-5346-b401-f1d1a6332147"))
  (text "DEVICE RAIL SENSE / open collector, positive hysteresis, UART disabled by default"
    (at 12.7 81.28 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "4cd54d52-4fc3-5c7d-826a-ded2a5e1e5d3"))
  (text "BOTH UART DIRECTIONS / 3.3V LOGIC / partial-power-down buffer"
    (at 12.7 139.7 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "eaefe44e-56eb-59d0-907b-879b86c3ee58"))
  (text "MANUAL BOOTLOADER: hold BOOT, pulse RESET, connect esptool, then release BOOT."
    (at 12.7 215.9 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "e33c4ffc-b86a-532d-bf0b-d4178879084d"))
  (text "Micro-B powers handheld. Adapter VCC is NC. FX_3V3 is local fixture power, never the pogo sense net."
    (at 12.7 254.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "ce501e9b-6dbb-5ec5-896a-97cc70f70225"))
  (text "Device rail absent: UART_OE_N high, both buffers high impedance. Manual switches only sink to GND."
